DESCRIPTION:Museum exhibits + Art\nhttps://ma.to/event/wang-li-ou-calligra
 phy-seals-13-nov-2026\n\nWang Li-ou's calligraphy and seal-carving exhibi
 tion presents work from her decades-long artistic practice. Her seal engr
 aving draws on Qin and Han dynasty traditions\, with confident knife work
  and an individual style. Wang Li-ou graduated from the Suzhou Arts and C
 rafts School in 1982. The exhibition runs November 6-20\, 2026.
